    - [RQ1: Bloat Prevalence (Section 3.1)](#rq1-bloat-prevalence-section-31)
    - [RQ2: Security Impact (Section 3.2)](#rq2-security-impact-section-32)
    - [RQ3: Root Causes (Section 3.3)](#rq3-root-causes-section-33)
